{"5122110": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Cozy Tree Co.", "steam_appid": 5122110, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Cozy Tree Co. is all about finding and decorating Christmas trees in whatever way you see fit! Take control of Hudson, the town's lumberjack, and explore the winter wonderland to find the perfect tree. Chop it down, and drag it back to your cozy log cabin to decorate to your heart's content!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5122110/extras/ed1973380a13163236329a73751813b1.poster.avif?t=1787973427\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5122110/extras/ed1973380a13163236329a73751813b1.webm?t=1787973427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5122110/extras/ed1973380a13163236329a73751813b1.mp4?t=1787973427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell your decorated Christmas trees to the townsfolk, and use those funds to buy ornaments from the shopkeeper. Grow your collection of Christmas ornaments and trinkets!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5122110/extras/5122c9033538c825491a464e7787f3a7.poster.avif?t=1787973427\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5122110/extras/5122c9033538c825491a464e7787f3a7.webm?t=1787973427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5122110/extras/5122c9033538c825491a464e7787f3a7.mp4?t=1787973427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Populate the town with Christmas trees, and work your way toward the massive town square tree!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Gameplay</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chop down and drag different trees of all types and sizes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate Christmas trees in whatever way you like or work on a customer's order to fund your business and growing decoration collection</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy or find new ornaments and decorations to enhance your creations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill the local town with holiday cheer until you're tasked with decorating the town square tree</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Cozy Tree Co. is all about finding and decorating Christmas trees in whatever way you see fit! Take control of Hudson, the town's lumberjack, and explore the winter wonderland to find the perfect tree. Chop it down, and drag it back to your cozy log cabin to decorate to your heart's content!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5122110/extras/ed1973380a13163236329a73751813b1.poster.avif?t=1787973427\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5122110/extras/ed1973380a13163236329a73751813b1.webm?t=1787973427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5122110/extras/ed1973380a13163236329a73751813b1.mp4?t=1787973427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell your decorated Christmas trees to the townsfolk, and use those funds to buy ornaments from the shopkeeper. Grow your collection of Christmas ornaments and trinkets!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5122110/extras/5122c9033538c825491a464e7787f3a7.poster.avif?t=1787973427\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5122110/extras/5122c9033538c825491a464e7787f3a7.webm?t=1787973427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5122110/extras/5122c9033538c825491a464e7787f3a7.mp4?t=1787973427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Populate the town with Christmas trees, and work your way toward the massive town square tree!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Gameplay</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chop down and drag different trees of all types and sizes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate Christmas trees in whatever way you like or work on a customer's order to fund your business and growing decoration collection</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy or find new ornaments and decorations to enhance your creations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill the local town with holiday cheer until you're tasked with decorating the town square tree</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "The Cozy Tree Co. is a relaxing game about chopping, decorating and selling Christmas trees. Search the winter wonderland for the perfect tree, get creative with your decorating, and sell your creations to spread holiday cheer!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "heade